# =====================================================================
# ProofLens Root Environment Configuration Reference
# =====================================================================

# Backend configuration is located in backend/.env
# Copy backend/.env.example to backend/.env:
#   cp backend/.env.example backend/.env

# Required environment variables:
# 1. DATABASE_URL (Optional: defaults to SQLite sqlite:///./sql_app.db if omitted)
# 2. PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID (Required for PayPal Escrow & Orders Checkout)
# 3. PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET (Required for PayPal OAuth access tokens)
# 4. PAYPAL_REDIRECT_URI (Default: http://localhost:4200)
# 5. GEMINI_API_KEY (Required for Multimodal AI Evidence Verification & Addendum Drafting)
